      "text": "本地 Docker vs 解耦远程沙盒池分流\n本地: 绑定不可变 Image ID + BoundedSemaphore 并发门控\n--network=none --read-only --cap-drop=ALL --pids-limit=64\n远程: RemoteHTTPSandboxBackend (免挂宿主机 docker.sock)\nPOST /api/internal/sandbox/execute + snapshot_sha256 复核",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "z1_backend",
      "originalText": "本地 Docker vs 解耦远程沙盒池分流\n本地: 绑定不可变 Image ID + BoundedSemaphore 并发门控\n--network=none --read-only --cap-drop=ALL --pids-limit=64\n远程: RemoteHTTPSandboxBackend (免挂宿主机 docker.sock)\nPOST /api/internal/sandbox/execute + snapshot_sha256 复核",
      "autoResize": true,
