      "text": "同机 Run 级排他执行锁 (execution_lock.py)\nexclusive_run() 采用 O_NOFOLLOW 打开运行锁文件\nflock 后通过 _same_dir_entry 复核 (st_dev, st_ino)\n彻底封堵并发 flock + unlink 锁失效竞态\n竞争失败抛 RunBusy · cleanup_stale_locks 定期清场",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "z2_flock",
      "originalText": "同机 Run 级排他执行锁 (execution_lock.py)\nexclusive_run() 采用 O_NOFOLLOW 打开运行锁文件\nflock 后通过 _same_dir_entry 复核 (st_dev, st_ino)\n彻底封堵并发 flock + unlink 锁失效竞态\n竞争失败抛 RunBusy · cleanup_stale_locks 定期清场",
