      "updated": 1763800000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "RRF 倒数秩融合与可选二阶段精排\nReciprocal Rank Fusion: Σ 1 / (k + rank_i), k=60\n规避异构分数尺度失衡，无需脆弱线性调参\n支持挂载 _apply_reranker 对 Top-N 候选做交叉精排",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "z4_rrf",
      "originalText": "RRF 倒数秩融合与可选二阶段精排\nReciprocal Rank Fusion: Σ 1 / (k + rank_i), k=60\n规避异构分数尺度失衡，无需脆弱线性调参\n支持挂载 _apply_reranker 对 Top-N 候选做交叉精排",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
