      "updated": 1763800000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "三源统一检索底座复用 (KnowledgeBase.from_documents)\n1. 静态研发规范与架构手册 (doc_search)\n2. 跨会话双层记忆 [[wiki-links]] 主题页\n3. 历史会话 Transcripts 轨迹片段 (memory_search)",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "z4_sources",
      "originalText": "三源统一检索底座复用 (KnowledgeBase.from_documents)\n1. 静态研发规范与架构手册 (doc_search)\n2. 跨会话双层记忆 [[wiki-links]] 主题页\n3. 历史会话 Transcripts 轨迹片段 (memory_search)",
      "autoResize": true,
